        "posts": [
          {
            "id": 608348,
            "name": "Kelyan Konan",
            "username": "Kelyan_Konan",
            "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/community.n8n.io/kelyan_konan/{size}/198034_2.png",
            "created_at": "2026-11-02T09:06:00.291Z",
            "cooked": "<p>Looking for n8n contractors for ongoing project work.</p>\n<p>Fixed-fee per build, $300–$900 depending on complexity.<br>\n2–4 builds per month once we’re at volume.</p>\n<p>Must handle error cases, fallbacks, and retries in every workflow —<br>\nnot just the happy path. Portfolio required.</p>\n<p>Send a 2-minute Loom walking through one past build. Show me the<br>\nscenario in the editor, how you handled a failure, and how you<br>\nnamed your modules.</p>\n<p>Remote, async OK. DM if interested.</p>\n<p><small><img src=\"https://emoji.discourse-cdn.com/twemoji/information_source.png?v=16\" title=\":information_source:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":information_source:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Replies are closed - contact the author using email, application form or direct message. Read more <a href=\"https://community.n8n.io/t/jobs-category-guidelines-posting-and-applying/941\">here</a>.</small></p>",
